  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening and improving the use of Arabic Language in UNESCO under</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Language is perhaps the most distinctive and defining feature of any human society. It is pivotal in the realm of information technology, the tool that all modern sectors use, and the foundation on which modern human communication is established.
With the aim to enhance multilingualism, and address the many-faceted relations between Arabic and the system of knowledge acquisition, a set of activities will be implemented under the strategic focus to promote linguist diversity and intercultural dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
